[I] User space TCP/IP pipe

[T] vanessa_socket is a library by Simon Horman to simplify the handling of
[T] TCP sockets, including opening, accepting and piping connections. It
[T] includes the vanessa_socket_pipe program, a user space TCP/IP pipe, and
[T] is used by perdition.

[U] https://projects.horms.net/projects/vanessa/

